From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 16:53:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Server ishga tushganda to'lov holatini konsolga chiqarish

PAYMENT_PROVIDER_TOKEN yuklanganmi yoki yo'qmi - endi startup logida
aniq ko'rinadi. Buni diagnostika uchun qo'shdim: "npm start" backend'ni
"node --watch" bilan ishga tushiradi, u .env o'zgarishini kuzatmaydi -
shuning uchun .env'ga token qo'shilgandan keyin serverni to'liq
to'xtatib (Ctrl+C) qayta ishga tushirish shart, aks holda eski
process'dagi bo'sh token qoladi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CCDFsxdUd5kMLM4dB9kaJ4
---
 src/index.js | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/index.js b/src/index.js
index 3966a1b..a12eb68 100644
--- a/src/index.js
+++ b/src/index.js
@@ -133,6 +133,11 @@ async function start() {
         ? `\u{1F4F1} Mini App: ${config.bot.webAppUrl}`
         : '⚠️  WEBAPP_URL hali sozlanmagan',
     );
+    console.log(
+      config.bot.paymentProviderToken
+        ? '\u{1F4B3} To‘lov: Payme yoqilgan (PAYMENT_PROVIDER_TOKEN topildi)'
+        : '\u{1F4B3} To‘lov: o‘chirilgan — PAYMENT_PROVIDER_TOKEN .env da yo‘q, naqd oqim ishlaydi',
+    );
   });
 
   if (mode === 'polling') {
